Code shared with PJA
--------------------

pas/praarith.pas (binary arithmetic coder), pas/prablake3.pas (BLAKE3) and
pas/collisions.py come from PJA (github.com/YadeWira/PJA, MIT, same author).
BLAKE3 follows its specification (github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3-specs).

packPNM
-------

PRA is the spiritual successor of packPNM by Matthias Stirner (LGPLv3). It
takes ideas from it, not code.
